{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"平\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X的大块直接交代人物当下的状态、原因和转折，单看大字也能串起故事；Y的加亮短语虽然抓住了关键词，但不少地方缺少必要的因果和情境。small：两版各有优势，X更集中补充身体和关系体验，Y更常把感受挂到具体的声部变化上，但也有些音乐描述偏离感受本身，整体判平；core：两版都持续呈现亲密带来的幸福与对它无法留住的担忧，没有明显偏题。concise：X的主要表达更省，Y有些屏把犹疑、不舍和情绪变化解释得过多，出现语义回环。human：Y稍好，X的“低声说着，不再勉强显得完整”“怎么待着都拿不准”“再往回藏自己反倒更难受”存在具体的搭配或省略问题；Y虽然也有“忘了藏好喜欢”“悲伤却进了幸福里面”等不够自然的表达，但整体语意衔接更顺。fine：X的感受更集中于观众身体和亲密关系中的具体体验，Y有不少小字直接描述歌声、声部和落音，偏离了这一项的评价重点。load：X每屏通常只有2—3个完整意群的大块，数量与停留时间相称；Y多屏出现5—7处加亮短语，视线需要频繁跳转，X虽然单块较长，但整体更容易扫读。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d0f5ac3f-04e9-4623-ab8d-9c9b62f22430", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T223334113114Z", "elapsed_seconds": 266.515, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T22:38:00.648571+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a26859192303f8dcb58dd71b4698781a54eeaad8bc623e18d847fb32a2c76916", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "